{"id":"15225d17616df0a4","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-prop-superset-closure.md","title":"Superset Closure","display":"prop-superset-closure — Superset Closure","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-superset-closure","aliases":["58-prop-superset-closure"],"display":"prop-superset-closure — Superset Closure","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-superset-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-superset-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-superset-closure — Superset Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,A,B,X,R\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal F,A,B,X,R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InclusionOrder}_S(R,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{InclusionOrder}_S(R,X)\\)</span> (powerset-inclusion relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}powerset\\text{-}inclusion\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\mathrm{InclusionOrder}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow R=\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X)\\mid A\\subseteq B\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}powerset\\text{-}inclusion\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\mathrm{InclusionOrder}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow R=\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X)\\mid A\\subseteq B\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}superset\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{InclusionOrder}_S(R,X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),R) \\to \\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to B\\in\\mathcal F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}superset\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{InclusionOrder}_S(R,X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),R) \\to \\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to B\\in\\mathcal F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The powerset inclusion order is an explicit relation witness in the assertion; it is not a prose-only abbreviation.</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is in the filter and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq B\">\\(A \\subseteq B\\)</span>, then <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> is also in the filter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F,A,B,X,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InclusionOrder}_S(R,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}powerset\\text{-}inclusion\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\mathrm{InclusionOrder}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow R=\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X)\\mid A\\subseteq B\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}superset\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{InclusionOrder}_S(R,X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),R) \\to \\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to B\\in\\mathcal F)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A \\subseteq B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":1086,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4001","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-prop-superset-closure.md|58-prop-superset-closure]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["1331244a5201bb99","2b6b1d9eb78a2714"]}